1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:02,210
Oh.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,210
No way.

3
00:00:04,210 --> 00:00:07,100
The last train is already gone.
What should we do?

4
00:00:07,470 --> 00:00:09,220
We can't get home.

5
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:12,850
(What on earth
is he thinking?)

6
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:15,350
The last train has already left.

7
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:16,810
We can't get home.

8
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:19,020
(Could it be that Haru senpai,
outside of acting...)

9
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:21,230
(is actually totally clueless about real life?)

10
00:00:21,230 --> 00:00:22,690
Minato.

11
00:00:22,690 --> 00:00:23,900
Do you have any money on you?

12
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:25,820
No, I don't have any cash.

13
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:27,070
What about you, Haru senpai?

14
00:00:27,070 --> 00:00:29,050
I don't have any either.

15
00:00:29,050 --> 00:00:30,530
Huh?

16
00:00:30,530 --> 00:00:33,240
Ah, what should we do?

17
00:00:33,830 --> 00:00:37,160
(He really is totally clueless, isn't he!?)

18
00:00:40,330 --> 00:00:42,920
Ah, I'm so hungry.
I can't take it anymore.

19
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:44,880
- Sigh.
- I know.

20
00:00:44,880 --> 00:00:46,630
We haven't eaten anything all day.

21
00:00:46,630 --> 00:00:47,840
Minato...

22
00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:48,970
What is it?

23
00:00:48,970 --> 00:00:52,140
Even if I starve to death here...

24
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:53,760
Take this as my last words.

25
00:00:53,760 --> 00:00:56,100
The show... must go on!

26
00:00:56,430 --> 00:00:58,180
You're being way too dramatic.

27
00:00:58,180 --> 00:00:58,930
Oh.

28
00:00:58,930 --> 00:01:01,140
My place is nearby.
Do you want to grab a bite?

29
00:01:01,140 --> 00:01:02,940
- Really!?
- Yeah.

30
00:01:03,440 --> 00:01:04,270
I'm in! I'm in!

31
00:01:04,270 --> 00:01:05,730
Hahaha!

32
00:01:05,730 --> 00:01:07,530
Ah, turn right there! To the right!

33
00:01:08,570 --> 00:01:10,030
Coming!

34
00:01:13,820 --> 00:01:15,410
What are you making?

35
00:01:15,410 --> 00:01:17,450
- Just you wait.
- Aw, come on.

36
00:01:17,450 --> 00:01:19,200
Oh, here it comes!

37
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:20,540
- Thanks for waiting.
- Oh, that looks delicious!!

38
00:01:20,540 --> 00:01:21,790
Here you go.

39
00:01:21,790 --> 00:01:24,920
Let's eat!

40
00:01:30,970 --> 00:01:32,010
Mmm, this is good!

41
00:01:32,010 --> 00:01:33,380
Wow, this is amazing!

42
00:01:35,470 --> 00:01:37,310
(He suddenly seems
just like a kid.)

43
00:01:37,310 --> 00:01:39,220
(I didn't know he could
make a face like that.)

44
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:42,350
I can't believe you can cook.

45
00:01:42,350 --> 00:01:43,650
You're really talented.

46
00:01:44,150 --> 00:01:46,480
It's only because you're starving.

47
00:01:48,190 --> 00:01:50,070
Aren't you eating?

48
00:01:50,070 --> 00:01:51,440
Oh...

49
00:01:51,440 --> 00:01:53,530
I have more.
Go ahead and eat.

50
00:01:53,530 --> 00:01:55,120
Really!?

51
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:56,950
Then I won't hold back.

52
00:01:59,040 --> 00:02:01,000
I'm going to polish it all off.

53
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,000
Be my guest.

54
00:02:11,710 --> 00:02:14,130
Huh? Are you okay?

55
00:02:21,850 --> 00:02:25,600
Ah! I thought I was going to die!

56
00:02:27,940 --> 00:02:30,400
That was delicious.

57
00:02:32,900 --> 00:02:34,990
I'll come back tomorrow.

58
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:37,450
Good work today!

59
00:02:37,450 --> 00:02:39,990
Good work... Wait.
Tomorrow?

60
00:02:40,830 --> 00:02:42,620
Huh!? Tomorrow!?

61
00:02:47,290 --> 00:02:49,210
Tomorrow, huh?
